{"id":"d1733562c097db66","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-solved-unification-problem.md","title":"求解形式与诱导替换","display":"df-solved-unification-problem — 求解形式与诱导替换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-solved-unification-problem","aliases":["56-df-solved-unification-problem"],"display":"df-solved-unification-problem — 求解形式与诱导替换","depends_on":["[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-substitution]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Proposition 7.7.3; proof of Theorem 7.7.6","source_printed_pages":"292–294","source_ocr_blocks":[313,314,315],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-solved-unification-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-solved-unification-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solved-unification-problem — 求解形式与诱导替换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Proposition 7.7.3; proof of Theorem 7.7.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"292–294"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>313</span><span>314</span><span>315</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal G\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,S,\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{Sol}\">\\(T,S,\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{Sol}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a>，替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 确定的左变量集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Solved}(E)\\iff E\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\times T\\land\n\\forall(x,s),(y,t)\\in E\\;(x=y\\Rightarrow s=t)\\land\n\\bigl(\\{x\\mid\\exists t\\;(x,t)\\in E\\}\\cap\\bigcup_{(x,t)\\in E}\\operatorname{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Solved}(E)\\iff E\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\times T\\land\n\\forall(x,s),(y,t)\\in E\\;(x=y\\Rightarrow s=t)\\land\n\\bigl(\\{x\\mid\\exists t\\;(x,t)\\in E\\}\\cap\\bigcup_{(x,t)\\in E}\\operatorname{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_E\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\exists t\\in T\\;((x,t)\\in E)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_E\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\exists t\\in T\\;((x,t)\\in E)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_E\\coloneqq E\\cup\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus D_E\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G\\land\\operatorname{Solved}(E)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_E\\coloneqq E\\cup\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus D_E\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G\\land\\operatorname{Solved}(E)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Solved允许空目标。每个左变量恰对应一个右项，且所有左变量均不出现于任意右项；因此所给图是一个全替换函数。这里把命题7.7.3最终留下的方程族抽成可复用定义，不宣称是原书另编号定义。σ_E仅在求解形式目标上定义，不对任意方程组强行给函数值。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$T,S,\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{Sol}$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]，替换见 [[56-df-substitution]]。$D$ 为由 $E$ 确定的左变量集。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$T,S,\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{Sol}$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]，替换见 [[56-df-substitution]]。$D$ 为由 $E$ 确定的左变量集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\in\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"T,S,\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{Sol}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Solved}(E)\\iff E\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\times T\\land\n\\forall(x,s),(y,t)\\in E\\;(x=y\\Rightarrow s=t)\\land\n\\bigl(\\{x\\mid\\exists t\\;(x,t)\\in E\\}\\cap\\bigcup_{(x,t)\\in E}\\operatorname{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"D_E\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\exists t\\in T\\;((x,t)\\in E)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma_E\\coloneqq E\\cup\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus D_E\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G\\land\\operatorname{Solved}(E)).","display":true}],"bytes":1804,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-solved-unification-problem.md]]"},{"id":"61b740fdfd46bce6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\in\\mathcal G$ 且 $\\operatorname{Solved}(E)$；$\\sigma_E,S,\\operatorname{Sol},\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}$ 见 [[56-df-solved-unification-problem]]，幂等性及支持判据见 [[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]、[[56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion]]。"}],"outgoing":["8198395909603c44","6228082765353868"]}